                {
                  "colspan": 0,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "Splits into two slips after passing inferior to plantar calcaneonavicular ligament;",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "4",
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "**Superficial slip:** inserts on the tuberosity of the navicular bone and sometimes medial cuneiform;",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "4",
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "**Deeper slip:** divides again into slips inserting on plantar surfaces of metatarsals 2 - 4 and second cuneiform",
                      "table": null,
